    "effect.left-space" : {
      "comment" : "The English string takes after\nSystem Settings > Keyboard > Keyboard Shortcuts... > Mission Control > Mission Control > Move left a space.\nBut it looks like for some languages, the translation inside macOS is suboptimal, so maybe you can come up with something better.\n[Dec 2025, macOS 26 Tahoe]",
